<title>UK: Cairn Energy extends Command offer deadline.</title>
<headline>Cairn Energy extends Command offer deadline.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.K.'s Cairn Energy Plc said on Friday it had extended the cash alternative deadline for shareholders of Australia's Command Petroleum, which it plans to take over, to November 28, 1996.</p>
<p>The British firm is offering A$1.10 cash per Command share or two Cairn shares for every 13 Command shares. The share offer deadline will end at 1700 GMT on November 22.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44-171-542 7717</p>
</text>
